  "status": "Application Under Consideration",
  "description": "APPLICATION FOR VEHICULAR CROSSOVER AND ASSOCIATED HARDSTANDING. ",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The safety of the proposed\r\naccess is dependent on only one vehicle being parked on the frontage at any one\r\ntime and on vehicles entering and exiting the site in forward gear with on site\r\nturning. The proposed development fails to provide a hardstanding of sufficient\r\nsize to meet TfL standards for on site turning and therefore does not\r\ndemonstrate that a vehicle can enter and exit the site in forward gear. The\r\nharm cannot be adequately mitigated through use of a planning condition or\r\nSection106 Agreement, as such measures would fail to meet the tests set out in\r\nparagraph 58 of the NPPF 2024. The development is therefore contrary to Policy\r\nT6 of the London Plan (2021) and Policies T16.1, T16.2, T16.3 and T16.4 of the\r\nMerton Local Plan (2024)"
  ],
